55
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:30,987
From January 2018 to April 2024, 92% of the

56
00:02:30,987 --> 00:02:34,492
bank's total transaction volume went

57
00:02:34,492 --> 00:02:37,705
unmonitored for money laundering.

58
00:02:37,705 --> 00:02:39,749
About $18.3 trillion.

59
00:02:40,199 --> 00:02:42,985
From at least 2014 through late 2022,

60
00:02:42,985 --> 00:02:45,920
prosecutors said, the bank added no new

61
00:02:45,920 --> 00:02:49,308
transaction monitoring scenarios, and made no

62
00:02:49,308 --> 00:02:52,018
material changes to the ones it had.

63
00:02:52,468 --> 00:02:55,237
Because of those gaps, according to the

64
00:02:55,237 --> 00:02:58,220
